<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Nevaeh Guide · Lightek</title><%= csrf_meta_tags %><link rel="stylesheet" href="/nevaeh/guide.css?v=1"><script src="/nevaeh/guide.js?v=1" defer></script></head>
<body><header class="ng-header"><a href="/dashboard/nevaeh" class="ng-brand">LIGHTEK <span>/</span> NEVAEH</a><nav><a href="/dashboard/nevaeh">Operating workspace ↗</a><a href="/dashboard">Dashboard</a></nav></header>
<div class="ng-shell"><aside class="ng-nav"><span class="ng-kicker">YOUR OPERATING MANUAL</span><h1>Know her.<br><em>Work with her.</em></h1><p>Instructions that stay connected to the software installed on your system.</p><form action="/dashboard/nevaeh/guide" method="get"><label for="guide-search">Search tutorials &amp; abilities</label><div class="ng-search"><input id="guide-search" name="q" value="<%= @query %>" placeholder="Try workers, Blender, Susu…"><button type="submit">Search</button></div></form>
<nav aria-label="Tutorials"><% @topics.each do |topic| %><a class="<%= 'active' if topic[:id]==@tutorial[:id] %>" href="<%= dashboard_nevaeh_guide_path(topic:topic[:id]) %>"><span><%= topic[:title] %></span><small><%= topic[:permission] %></small></a><% end %></nav></aside>
<main class="ng-main"><section class="ng-intro"><span class="ng-kicker">GUIDE / <%= @reference ? 'LIVE REFERENCE' : 'STEP-BY-STEP TUTORIAL' %></span><h2><%= @reference ? @reference[:title] : @tutorial[:title] %></h2><div class="ng-metrics"><div><strong><%= @coverage[:total] %></strong><span>Live reference entries</span></div><div><strong><%= @coverage[:documented] %></strong><span>Tutorial or declared fields</span></div><div class="<%= 'gap' if @coverage[:missing]>0 %>"><strong><%= @coverage[:missing] %></strong><span><a href="/dashboard/nevaeh/guide?q=schema_needed">Input schemas to publish ↗</a></span></div></div></section>
<% if @query.present? %><section class="ng-card"><h3>Search results for “<%= @query %>”</h3><div class="ng-results"><% @tutorial_matches.each do |topic| %><a href="<%= dashboard_nevaeh_guide_path(topic:topic[:id]) %>"><span class="ng-kicker">Tutorial</span><strong><%= topic[:title] %></strong></a><% end %><% @matches.first(100).each do |row| %><a href="<%= dashboard_nevaeh_guide_path(capability:row[:key]) %>"><code><%= row[:key] %></code><span><%= row[:title] %></span><small><%= row[:availability].humanize %> · <%= row[:coverage].humanize %></small></a><% end %><% if @matches.empty? && @tutorial_matches.empty? %><p>No matching tutorial or registered capability. Try a module name or open the capability catalog below.</p><% end %></div></section><% end %>
<% if @reference %><section class="ng-card ng-reference"><div class="ng-badges"><span><%= @reference[:availability].humanize %></span><span><%= @reference[:source] %></span></div><h3><code><%= @reference[:key] %></code></h3><dl><dt>Permission</dt><dd><%= @reference[:permission] %></dd><dt>How to use it</dt><dd><%= @reference[:how_to] %></dd><dt>How to verify it</dt><dd><%= @reference[:verification] %></dd><dt>If it fails</dt><dd><%= @reference[:recovery] %></dd></dl>
<h4>Invocation pattern</h4><pre><code><%= @reference[:example] %></code></pre><a class="ng-button" href="/dashboard/nevaeh?command=<%= ERB::Util.url_encode(@reference[:example]) %>">Put this in Nevaeh’s input ↗</a><p class="ng-note">This opens an editable instruction. Replace example IDs and filenames before sending it.</p>
<% if @reference[:coverage]=='schema_needed' %><div class="ng-gap"><h4>Input schema not published</h4><p>This ability has a live reference entry, but its complete input contract still needs documentation. The Guide will not invent required fields.</p><% if @reference[:input_hints].present? %><p>Implementation-derived input hints (not a complete schema): <code><%= @reference[:input_hints].join(', ') %></code></p><% end %><a href="/dashboard/nevaeh?command=<%= ERB::Util.url_encode("open a ticket about documenting the input schema, examples and acceptance evidence for #{@reference[:key]}") %>">Prepare a documentation ticket ↗</a></div><% elsif @reference[:inputs] %><h4>Declared fields</h4><pre><code><%= JSON.pretty_generate(@reference[:inputs]) %></code></pre><% end %></section><% end %>
<article class="ng-card ng-tutorial"><%= nevaeh_document_html(@tutorial[:body].sub(/\A# .*?\n/,'')) %></article>
<% if @manuals.present? %><section class="ng-card"><h3>Installed module manuals</h3><p>Deep references for the rest of your platform, including mail, payments, hosting, reservations, Studio and broadcasting. These follow the installed release.</p><div class="ng-results"><% @manuals.each do |manual| %><a href="/employee/software-library?id=<%= manual[:id] %>"><strong><%= manual[:title] %></strong><small><%= manual[:path] %></small></a><% end %></div></section><% end %>
<section class="ng-card"><h3>Live capability reference</h3><p>Installed registrations, resource contracts, commands and application adapters appear here. Availability and documentation coverage are reported separately.</p><div class="ng-catalog"><% @catalog.each do |row| %><a href="<%= dashboard_nevaeh_guide_path(capability:row[:key]) %>"><code><%= row[:key] %></code><span><%= row[:title] %></span><small class="<%= 'gap' if row[:coverage]=='schema_needed' %>"><%= row[:availability].humanize %> · <%= row[:coverage].humanize %></small></a><% end %></div></section>
<footer>Guide content follows the installed release. Actions use your current account permissions; examples do not grant access.</footer></main></div></body></html>
